Row 0:{Character: Night Girl,Real name: Lydda Jath,Home world: Kathoon,Membership notes: Pre-Crisis version first appeared in Adventure Comics #306 (March 1963).
Legion membership first mentioned by Starman in Justice Society of America vol. 3, #6 (July 2007) and confirmed in Action Comics #860 (February 2008).,Powers: Super-strength when not in direct sunlight.}
Row 1:{Character: Chameleon Girl,Real name: Yera Allon,Home world: Durla,Membership notes: Pre-Crisis version first appeared (impersonating Shrinking Violet) in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 2, #286 (April 1982).
True form and identity revealed in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 2, #305 (November 1983).
Legion membership first revealed in Action Comics #861 (March 2008).,Powers: Shapeshifting.}
Row 2:{Character: Karate Kid II,Real name: Myg,Home world: Lythyl,Membership notes: Joined as a replacement for Val Armorr, as revealed in Final Crisis: Legion of 3 Worlds #1 (October 2008), unlike his counterpart who did not join the original team prior to Crisis on Infinite Earths.
Killed by Radiation Roy in Final Crisis: Legion of 3 Worlds #3 (April 2009).,Powers: Mastery of all known martial arts.}
Row 3:{Character: Green Lantern,Real name: Rond Vidar,Home world: Earth,Membership notes: Pre-Crisis version first appeared in Adventure Comics #349 (October 1966); granted honorary membership in Adventure Comics #360 (September 1967).
Last remaining member of the Green Lantern Corps, as revealed in Final Crisis: Legion of 3 Worlds #2 (November 2008).
Killed in the same issue by Superboy-Prime.,Powers: Possesses a Green Lantern power ring.}
Row 4:{Character: XS,Real name: Jenni Ognats,Home world: Aarok,Membership notes: First appeared in Legionnaires #0 (October 1994); granddaughter of Barry Allen and first cousin of Bart Allen.
Native of the same universe as the post-Infinite Crisis team, as revealed in Final Crisis: Legion of 3 Worlds #3 (April 2009).
Joined the Earth-247 team in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 4, #62 (November 1994).
Joined the post-Infinite Crisis team in Final Crisis: Legion of 3 Worlds #5 (September 2009).
Post-Flashpoint no longer listed as a member of the Legion.,Powers: Superspeed.}
Row 5:{Character: Gates,Real name: Ti'julk Mr'asz,Home world: Vyrga,Membership notes: First appeared in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 4, #66 (March 1995).
Joined the Earth-247 team in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 4, #76 (January 1996).
Joined the post-Infinite Crisis team in Final Crisis: Legion of 3 Worlds #5 (September 2009).,Powers: Creation of teleportation \gates\"."}
Row 6:{Character: Earth-Man,Real name: Kirt Niedrigh,Home world: Earth,Membership notes: Pre-Crisis version first appeared (as \Absorbency Boy\") in Superboy and the Legion of Super-Heroes #218 (July 1976).,Powers: nan}
Row 7:{Character: Joined in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6,Real name: #2 (August 2010).,Home world: nan,Membership notes: nan,Powers: nan}
Row 8:{Character: Died battling the Adversary in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6,Real name: #16 (October 2011).",Home world: Super-power absorption and duplication.,Membership notes: nan,Powers: nan}
Row 9:{Character: Comet Queen,Real name: Grava,Home world: Extal Colony,Membership notes: Pre-Crisis version first appeared in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 2, #304 (October 1983) as a student at the Legion Academy.
Joined between Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6, #16 (October 2011) and Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 7, #1 (November 2011).,Powers: Space flight, comet gas extrusion.}
Row 10:{Character: Chemical Kid,Real name: Hadru Jamik,Home world: Phlon,Membership notes: First appeared in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6, #6 (December 2010) as a student at the Legion Academy.
Joined between Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6, #16 (October 2011) and Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 7, #1 (November 2011).,Powers: Catalyze chemical reactions.}
Row 11:{Character: Glorith II,Real name: Glorith,Home world: Unknown,Membership notes: First appeared in Adventure Comics #523 (April 2011) as a student at the Legion Academy.
Joined between Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6, #16 (October 2011) and Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 7, #1 (November 2011).,Powers: Manipulation of mystical energies.}
Row 12:{Character: Dragonwing,Real name: Marya Pai,Home world: Earth,Membership notes: First appeared in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6, #6 (December 2010) as a student at the Legion Academy.
Joined between Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6, #16 (October 2011) and Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 7, #1 (November 2011).,Powers: Fire breath and acid absorption.}
Row 13:{Character: Harmonia,Real name: Harmonia Li,Home world: Earth,Membership notes: First appeared in Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6, #1 (July 2010).
Joined between Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 6, #16 (October 2011) and Legion of Super-Heroes vol. 7, #1 (November 2011).,Powers: Elemental.}

