Row 9:{Speed: 161 km/h (100 mph),Date: 1934-11-30,Country: UK,Train: LNER Class A3 4472 Flying Scotsman,Arr.: Loc,Power: Steam,State: Unmod.,Comments: In 1934, Flying Scotsman achieved the first authenticated 100 mph (161 km/h) by a steam locomotive.}
