Row 3:{Nation: Jamaica,Date: 2005,Quantity: 3.0,Type: 4207,Notes: The three vessels which form the County-class are HMJS Surrey, HMJS Cornwall and HMJS Middlesex. They were built in the Netherlands, and the last vessel was delivered in December 2006.}
Row 4:{Nation: Barbados,Date: 2007,Quantity: 3.0,Type: 4207,Notes: Built for the Barbados Coast Guard. HMBS Leonard C Banfield and HMBS Rudyard Lewis were scheduled to be delivered in 2008. HMBS Trident was scheduled for delivery in 2009.}
