Row 6:{Nation: South Africa,Date: 2004,Quantity: 3.0,Type: 4708,Notes: Lillian Ngoyi-class environmental inshore patrol vessels: Lillian Ngoyi, Ruth First and Victoria Mxenge are employed by the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries.}
