Row 35:{Unnamed: 0: nan,Num: 36,Pod Color: ,Nickname: Poki,Short Description: A small yellow and brown opossum-like experiment with a spiked tail. Designed to poke holes in liquid containers. Was seen in "Shoe.",Episode: 203, 215, Leroy & Stitch,Unnamed: 6: nan}
Row 36:{Unnamed: 0: nan,Num: 37,Pod Color: ,Nickname: Snipper,Short Description: ,Episode: Leroy & Stitch,Unnamed: 6: nan}
