Row 39:{Unnamed: 0: nan,Num: 40,Pod Color: ,Nickname: Backhoe,Short Description: A gray mole-like experiment with large black claws. Designed to scrape up vegetation, and is also an efficient digger. He was part of the "rebellion" in "Checkers," and he dug the pool for "Jumba and Pleakley's Bed and No Breakfast." First seen in "Shoe.",Episode: 203, 207, 215, Leroy & Stitch,Unnamed: 6: nan}
