Row 43:{Unnamed: 0: nan,Num: 44,Pod Color: Green,Nickname: Forehead,Short Description: A pink, four-headed mustached experiment with four arms and four red bowties on his necks that speaks English. Designed to sing barbershop music off-key, agonizing anyone who hears it. His one true place is with Mrs. Hasagawa as one of her "cats.",Episode: 220, Leroy & Stitch,Unnamed: 6: nan}
