Row 53:{Unnamed: 0: nan,Num: 54,Pod Color: Blue,Nickname: Fudgy,Short Description: An experiment made of chocolate that looks like a blob. Designed to drown people in his sticky sweetness. When he was activated, he was called 119, and he was mistaken for experiment 611. The mistake with his number was due to Jumba's untidy database, although Jumba later corrected this mistake. Was rescued in "Snafu.",Episode: 119, 226,Unnamed: 6: nan}
