Row 76:{Unnamed: 0: nan,Num: 77,Pod Color: ,Nickname: Zawp,Short Description: A fat purple Nosy (199)-like experiment with black nails, a dark blue stripe around his torso between his chest and stomach, a dark blue circle on the top of his head, dark blue-striped ears, a larger belly and a slightly smaller, gold nose. Designed to irritate people with his constant snoring. His one true place is with Mrs. Hasagawa as one of her "cats.",Episode: 220, Leroy & Stitch,Unnamed: 6: nan}
